sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Mobile App
    participant API as Document Service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Storage as B2 (Object Storage)
    participant Queue as Processing Queue
    participant Worker as Pipeline Worker

    Client->>API: POST /documents (metadata only)
    API->>DB: INSERT documents (status = pending_upload)
    DB-->>API: document_id
    API->>Storage: request presigned PUT URL
    Storage-->>API: presigned URL
    API-->>Client: document_id + presigned URL

    Client->>Storage: PUT file bytes directly
    Storage-->>Client: 200 OK

    Client->>API: PATCH /documents/{id}/confirm
    API->>DB: UPDATE status = uploaded
    API->>Queue: publish "document uploaded" event
    API-->>Client: 200 OK

    Queue->>Worker: consume event
    Worker->>Storage: fetch raw file
    Worker->>Worker: parse, chunk, embed, tag
    Worker->>DB: INSERT document_chunks
    Worker->>DB: UPDATE status = ready

    Note over Client,DB: Client can poll GET /documents/{id}<br/>to see status move from processing to ready
